WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 39=

01:44.080 --> 01:44.570
Come on.

01:45.130 --> 01:47.290
I've come up with a good solution.

01:48.360 --> 01:49.050
If...

01:49.850 --> 01:52.130
If Mu Xun catches up with me...

01:53.440 --> 01:55.720
Chancellor Liu and Yan Shang
are both dead anyway.

01:56.960 --> 01:57.690
I'll just say

01:58.320 --> 01:59.690
it was Mu Wanyao!

02:00.440 --> 02:01.930
She's the real usurper!

02:04.880 --> 02:05.770
Yan Shang is dead?

02:06.520 --> 02:06.770
I...

02:07.770 --> 02:10.040
I was forced to flee to Hangzhou!

02:11.040 --> 02:13.480
I... I can give him back the throne.

02:15.880 --> 02:16.640
How did he die?

02:17.920 --> 02:18.720
It's settled, then.

02:19.040 --> 02:20.090
I'll definitely survive!

02:20.370 --> 02:21.640
I'll definitely survive!

02:22.410 --> 02:24.160
Sitting on this throne

02:24.480 --> 02:26.130
is like sitting on a brazier.

02:26.810 --> 02:28.040
It's burning my backside!

02:30.010 --> 02:30.440
Oh, right.

02:31.480 --> 02:32.370
Before I leave,

02:33.530 --> 02:34.880
there's one more thing to do

02:36.410 --> 02:37.690
to make absolutely sure I'm safe.

02:40.410 --> 02:42.320
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.160
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

02:48.970 --> 02:49.690
What did Your Majesty

02:51.480 --> 02:52.090
just say?

02:53.850 --> 02:55.570
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

02:56.760 --> 02:58.530
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

02:59.760 --> 03:00.370
Think about it.

03:01.320 --> 03:02.810
If Mu Xun catches up with me,

03:03.160 --> 03:05.640
he won't kill a Retired Emperor.

03:12.810 --> 03:13.410
Yes, yes.

03:14.880 --> 03:15.290
Exactly.

03:16.370 --> 03:17.090
So...

03:19.290 --> 03:20.880
You'll put Si'er in harm's way

03:22.440 --> 03:24.010
to die in your place?

03:28.090 --> 03:28.480
Come on!

03:29.040 --> 03:29.920
Draft the edict

03:30.370 --> 03:31.090
for me right now.

03:31.200 --> 03:31.920
There's no time to lose!

03:35.920 --> 03:36.320
Wait.

03:39.690 --> 03:40.290
What if...

03:41.920 --> 03:43.530
What if Sheng'an doesn't fall,

03:44.880 --> 03:46.250
and this was all a false alarm?

03:47.570 --> 03:50.200
What if Mu Wanyao comes back?

03:51.290 --> 03:51.690
Then what?

03:54.530 --> 03:55.200
Si'er...

03:56.090 --> 03:56.880
Chunhua...

03:57.440 --> 03:58.530
The emperor is young,
and his mother is strong.

03:59.410 --> 04:01.949
Chunhua and Mu Wanyao are in league.

04:01.991 --> 04:02.831
What if...

04:03.690 --> 04:06.440
What if she helps Wanyao seize Si'er?

04:06.810 --> 04:07.090
Then...

04:08.810 --> 04:10.130
then this edict

04:10.970 --> 04:13.640
would be my death warrant.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.440
Your Majesty,

04:18.280 --> 04:19.760
how thoughtful of you now.

04:22.610 --> 04:23.080
Come here!

04:27.370 --> 04:28.370
Write this down.

04:29.760 --> 04:31.200
I'll abdicate at once.

04:32.320 --> 04:32.810
And

04:35.050 --> 04:36.840
order the Noble Consort's execution.

04:43.130 --> 04:43.760
Hurry up!

04:45.080 --> 04:45.960
Why aren't you moving?

04:46.490 --> 04:47.170
You don't expect me

04:47.760 --> 04:50.349
to take Chunhua to Hangzhou, do you?

04:50.391 --> 04:51.751
There's no time!

04:52.130 --> 04:53.400
Cui Quan is preparing the carriage.

04:53.930 --> 04:56.200
I must leave in an hour!

04:56.370 --> 04:57.170
And before that,

04:58.080 --> 04:59.690
she must be executed!

05:01.250 --> 05:01.840
Quick!

05:18.760 --> 05:19.640
Once you've drafted the edict,

05:20.960 --> 05:21.960
carry out the order for me and hang her.

05:22.810 --> 05:24.280
Where's my imperial seal?

05:27.170 --> 05:29.010
Where has my seal gone?

05:42.490 --> 05:43.280
Found it!

05:54.610 --> 05:54.960
Don't!

06:38.250 --> 06:39.400
You've committed

06:40.440 --> 06:41.810
far too many evil deeds.

06:45.840 --> 06:46.840
You've ruined

06:47.520 --> 06:48.520
Chunhua's life,

06:48.960 --> 06:50.370
and mine too!

07:04.010 --> 07:04.610
Your Majesty,

07:05.520 --> 07:07.170
when are we leaving?

07:22.690 --> 07:24.200
His Majesty needs a little more time.

07:26.730 --> 07:28.010
Attendant Liu,

07:28.440 --> 07:29.170
you're here?

07:30.730 --> 07:32.280
His Majesty wants to see the consort.

07:33.490 --> 07:34.570
Send for her immediately.

08:18.760 --> 08:19.250
Chunhua,

08:21.080 --> 08:21.570
come with me.

08:32.490 --> 08:32.730
Come.

08:34.280 --> 08:34.640
Look.

08:45.640 --> 08:46.130
Don't be afraid.

08:47.920 --> 08:48.370
Don't be afraid.

08:51.800 --> 08:52.680
He's dead now.

08:56.850 --> 08:58.040
I'm finally free.

09:00.880 --> 09:01.520
Wenji,

09:02.490 --> 09:03.760
you've committed regicide.

09:13.680 --> 09:14.090
Chunhua,

09:18.210 --> 09:19.370
stay and talk with me for a while.

09:35.680 --> 09:36.210
Chunhua,

09:39.010 --> 09:39.640
do you know

09:41.680 --> 09:43.610
why I never proposed to you back then?

09:48.010 --> 09:49.040
Perhaps

09:50.450 --> 09:52.880
I hadn't made you love me enough.

10:06.730 --> 10:07.130
No.

10:10.280 --> 10:11.090
It was because

10:13.730 --> 10:14.800
I was weak,

10:16.640 --> 10:17.330
selfish,

10:19.160 --> 10:20.250
and a coward.

10:30.280 --> 10:32.520
I knew you were a maid,

10:33.880 --> 10:35.330
not a noblewoman from Sheng'an.

10:36.880 --> 10:37.610
And I was frustrated.

10:41.800 --> 10:42.680
I reserved

10:44.280 --> 10:46.090
the place of my lawful wife

10:47.130 --> 10:48.640
until I'd passed the imperial exam,

10:50.520 --> 10:51.610
so I could marry

10:53.010 --> 10:53.680
a noblewoman

10:54.850 --> 10:57.040
from one of the great clans.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.400
I've often wondered over the years...

11:17.680 --> 11:19.800
If I'd proposed to you back then,

11:21.850 --> 11:23.330
none of this would have happened.

11:24.680 --> 11:26.250
The night Si'er was born,

11:31.560 --> 11:33.330
the life we dreamed of together

11:34.330 --> 11:35.610
could have been real.

11:55.400 --> 11:55.880
Chunhua,

11:58.010 --> 11:58.760
you must be

12:01.330 --> 12:02.210
so disappointed in me.

12:34.850 --> 12:36.400
Forgive my boldness,

12:37.210 --> 12:38.760
but when will His Majesty

12:39.370 --> 12:40.850
and the Noble Consort depart?

12:44.250 --> 12:46.130
His Majesty and I must speak in private.

12:46.490 --> 12:47.130
No one is to come in!

13:06.520 --> 13:07.450
Wenji, what's wrong?

13:08.490 --> 13:09.280
Did you poison yourself?

13:09.680 --> 13:10.210
Wenji!

13:16.850 --> 13:17.130
I...

13:19.040 --> 13:20.040
I feel terrible...

13:23.560 --> 13:24.010
Chunhua,

13:26.280 --> 13:26.920
please let me

13:28.400 --> 13:29.330
rest in your arms

13:30.280 --> 13:31.250
for a little while.

13:51.800 --> 13:52.880
He deserved to die.

13:55.370 --> 13:57.280
But you shouldn't have died with him.

13:58.250 --> 13:59.010
It's not worth it.

14:05.970 --> 14:06.800
It is worth it.

14:09.330 --> 14:10.400
Only with him dead

14:12.400 --> 14:13.370
can you and Si'er

14:15.040 --> 14:16.800
live safely and in peace.

14:17.250 --> 14:19.010
But all I want is for you to live!

14:30.880 --> 14:31.610
Don't cry.

14:35.880 --> 14:36.400
Please don't cry.

16:10.800 --> 16:11.680
You're so beautiful.

16:25.130 --> 16:25.520
Wenji!

16:26.490 --> 16:26.920
Wenji!

16:29.370 --> 16:29.970
Wenji!

16:38.330 --> 16:38.880
Wenji.

16:42.640 --> 16:44.160
The first time I met you,

16:46.250 --> 16:47.680
I fell in love with you.

16:48.320 --> 16:51.280
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

16:52.490 --> 16:54.069
But only after returning to Sheng'an

16:54.111 --> 16:55.661
did I realize how I felt.

16:56.550 --> 17:00.320
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

17:00.370 --> 17:01.160
I thought

17:01.160 --> 17:03.830
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

17:03.880 --> 17:05.650
we would never meet again.

17:05.650 --> 17:07.650
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

17:07.650 --> 17:08.970
But I never imagined

17:08.970 --> 17:12.230
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

17:13.010 --> 17:14.690
you'd come to Sheng'an to find me.

17:14.690 --> 17:17.020
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

17:17.140 --> 17:19.600
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

17:19.600 --> 17:21.170
From the very beginning,

17:24.320 --> 17:26.760
I've always loved you.

17:28.970 --> 17:30.450
I love you so much.

17:31.050 --> 17:33.010
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

17:33.060 --> 17:35.660
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

17:35.710 --> 17:38.410
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

17:39.610 --> 17:43.330
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

17:44.010 --> 17:45.120
That's...

17:45.162 --> 17:46.580
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

17:47.040 --> 17:48.040
wonderful to hear.

17:48.082 --> 17:49.710
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

17:49.760 --> 17:52.090
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

17:52.300 --> 17:55.240
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

18:08.600 --> 18:09.170
Chunhua,

18:10.600 --> 18:11.280
in a little while,

18:12.560 --> 18:14.650
when all this is over,

18:15.400 --> 18:17.510
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

18:17.560 --> 18:18.320
go back

18:18.970 --> 18:19.930
to your room,

18:21.840 --> 18:22.800
hold Si'er close,

18:24.730 --> 18:25.520
and get

18:25.562 --> 18:27.200
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

18:27.250 --> 18:28.080
some good sleep.

18:28.122 --> 18:29.990
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

18:30.040 --> 18:31.210
Do you understand?

18:31.930 --> 18:34.400
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

18:34.450 --> 18:35.210
I will.

18:35.600 --> 18:39.310
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

18:40.170 --> 18:41.560
You should sleep too, Wenji.

18:41.602 --> 18:44.100
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

18:44.220 --> 18:46.270
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

18:46.320 --> 18:47.170
Do you remember

18:49.080 --> 18:50.600
our little village?

18:50.642 --> 18:54.070
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

18:55.560 --> 18:56.800
You'll dream of it.

18:58.130 --> 19:00.090
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

19:00.930 --> 19:02.120
I can already

19:04.010 --> 19:05.170
see it.

19:06.690 --> 19:10.360
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

19:11.280 --> 19:11.800
There are

19:11.842 --> 19:13.510
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

19:13.560 --> 19:14.280
mountains,

19:14.710 --> 19:16.470
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

19:16.520 --> 19:17.410
rivers,

19:17.452 --> 19:19.130
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

19:19.970 --> 19:20.520
and...

19:20.562 --> 19:22.350
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

19:27.120 --> 19:29.210
those flowers.

19:30.110 --> 19:32.770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

19:33.630 --> 19:35.590
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

19:35.640 --> 19:38.240
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

19:38.290 --> 19:40.990
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

19:42.190 --> 19:45.910
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

19:46.710 --> 19:49.160
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

19:50.210 --> 19:52.290
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

19:52.340 --> 19:54.670
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

19:54.880 --> 19:57.820
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

19:58.880 --> 20:05.740
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

20:07.160 --> 20:10.720
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

20:11.220 --> 20:14.330
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

20:17.790 --> 20:22.800
♪How sweet the spring,
how hard to leave♪

20:31.450 --> 20:33.520
The criminal Liu Wenji

20:34.080 --> 20:35.800
committed regicide and treason

20:36.250 --> 20:37.840
and has been executed.

20:55.210 --> 20:57.360
Your Majesty, my condolences!

20:58.210 --> 20:59.120
Ministers, listen carefully!

21:01.170 --> 21:02.210
I have an imperial decree

21:03.170 --> 21:04.320
to proclaim throughout the realm.

21:08.490 --> 21:09.650
Mu Xun, the deposed Crown Prince,

21:10.930 --> 21:11.970
was blessed with imperial favor,

21:13.490 --> 21:14.760
yet raised the banner of rebellion

21:15.170 --> 21:16.360
and attacked the imperial capital,

21:18.280 --> 21:20.040
letting his followers hurt the people.

21:21.170 --> 21:22.210
All officials

21:22.760 --> 21:24.930
must honor the valor of the Grand
Princess, Guardian of the Realm

21:25.410 --> 21:26.730
and the steadfast integrity

21:27.560 --> 21:28.650
of Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

21:29.490 --> 21:30.520
I hereby issue this solemn decree

21:32.280 --> 21:33.410
to every circuit

21:35.360 --> 21:36.170
as a warning

21:37.280 --> 21:38.080
to all.

21:40.970 --> 21:43.760
We obey the Empress Dowager's decree!

21:54.970 --> 21:56.450
Only a hundred more li to Sheng'an.

21:57.600 --> 21:57.930
Change horses.

21:58.120 --> 21:58.360
Yes.

22:02.560 --> 22:03.170
Urgent report!

22:09.650 --> 22:10.120
Your Highness, urgent news!

22:10.650 --> 22:11.730
Everyone inside the city still holds.

22:12.010 --> 22:13.010
The rebels haven't broken through.

22:14.840 --> 22:15.210
But...

22:15.930 --> 22:17.120
the city is out of arrows and food.

22:17.450 --> 22:18.760
Commander Yan died defending the city.

22:23.840 --> 22:24.360
Who...

22:26.490 --> 22:27.210
did you say was killed?

22:28.040 --> 22:28.490
Yan Shang.

22:29.250 --> 22:30.170
Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

23:21.080 --> 23:21.490
Your Highness!

23:22.970 --> 23:23.280
Your Highness!

23:41.930 --> 23:42.410
Go.

23:44.650 --> 23:45.250
Sheng'an

23:48.490 --> 23:49.410
still needs reinforcements.

23:53.600 --> 23:54.080
Give me a hand.

23:54.410 --> 23:54.800
Sir.

23:55.490 --> 23:56.760
Your hands are shaking. Take a break.

23:57.120 --> 23:57.732
- I'll take over.
- I'm not stopping.

23:58.360 --> 23:59.490
We can't let the wall fall.

24:07.760 --> 24:08.690
Here, give that to me.

24:08.970 --> 24:10.210
Look at those injuries on your hands.

24:10.690 --> 24:13.520
We've used up all our arrows and powder.

24:14.250 --> 24:15.360
All we have left are bricks and stones.

24:16.970 --> 24:17.490
Give us a hand.

24:17.690 --> 24:18.520
Come on, come on.

24:19.320 --> 24:19.800
Move.

24:21.890 --> 24:22.170
Come on.

24:25.010 --> 24:25.250
Here.

24:25.690 --> 24:25.989
(Peace Throughout the Realm)
Thank you.

24:26.031 --> 24:26.431
It's fine.

24:28.450 --> 24:28.760
Your Royal Highness.

24:28.970 --> 24:29.730
The new emperor has passed away.

24:30.010 --> 24:31.010
Is the news confirmed?

24:31.490 --> 24:32.120
Without a doubt.

24:32.320 --> 24:33.280
An official report came from Jinzhou.

24:33.450 --> 24:34.120
The funeral has already been held.

24:34.760 --> 24:35.450
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness!

24:36.360 --> 24:37.010
As I thought,

24:37.600 --> 24:38.800
Heaven's mandate is still mine.

24:42.360 --> 24:43.170
Beat the war drums!

24:51.520 --> 24:52.930
The wound is serious.

24:56.080 --> 24:59.080
I wonder if anything else can be done.

25:00.080 --> 25:01.189
It's not getting any better.

25:01.231 --> 25:01.991
Yes.

25:02.280 --> 25:03.259
Do you think Imperial Physician Huang

25:03.301 --> 25:04.991
has any way to treat it?

25:09.490 --> 25:10.560
We must trust the physician.

25:27.010 --> 25:27.760
Attend me.

25:33.210 --> 25:34.210
Is anyone there?

25:54.800 --> 25:55.690
Someone, come!

26:03.320 --> 26:03.930
Your Majesty.

26:07.360 --> 26:08.010
Where is everyone?

26:09.730 --> 26:10.690
Where have they all...

26:13.800 --> 26:14.840
You're crying?

26:16.970 --> 26:17.690
Whatever for?

26:18.040 --> 26:18.560
I've heard

26:19.360 --> 26:20.320
the city gate is about to fall.

26:22.360 --> 26:23.730
And that's why you're crying?

26:27.170 --> 26:30.250
The realm hasn't fallen yet.
Why are you crying?

26:31.520 --> 26:32.800
I'm still here!

26:58.320 --> 26:59.890
Help me get dressed.

28:02.360 --> 28:03.730
Your Royal Highness,
look at the gate tower!

28:04.970 --> 28:05.560
It's His Majesty!

28:13.320 --> 28:14.250
Father.

28:16.450 --> 28:17.840
You haven't fled after all.

28:18.420 --> 28:22.620
(Guanghua Gate)

28:22.930 --> 28:23.600
Mu Xun.

28:25.600 --> 28:26.760
Do you know your crime?

28:30.600 --> 28:31.120
Father,

28:32.600 --> 28:33.930
your precious chosen son

28:34.800 --> 28:36.250
has abandoned the city and fled.

28:36.600 --> 28:37.170
I wonder

28:38.170 --> 28:39.730
what you think of him now.

28:40.280 --> 28:41.280
I think

28:42.730 --> 28:44.690
a coward who flees the city

28:45.930 --> 28:48.600
is better than a monstrous traitor!

28:53.690 --> 28:55.760
If you hadn't taken everything from me,

28:57.320 --> 28:58.520
none of this would have happened.

28:58.890 --> 29:00.250
Ever since you were young,

29:01.410 --> 29:03.450
I taught you military strategy

29:04.490 --> 29:07.520
so that one day you'd defend the realm,

29:08.280 --> 29:11.930
not turn your sword on Sheng'an!

29:13.840 --> 29:14.210
I

29:15.250 --> 29:16.450
have lived a life of mere survival.

29:18.010 --> 29:19.170
I was no great emperor.

29:20.690 --> 29:22.170
But as a ruler,

29:22.690 --> 29:23.690
however incompetent I may be,

29:24.320 --> 29:26.040
I must never turn my army

29:26.360 --> 29:28.320
against my own people!

29:29.250 --> 29:29.890
But you

29:30.560 --> 29:33.450
have plunged our realm into war

29:34.170 --> 29:35.600
and exposed countless innocent people

29:36.520 --> 29:37.560
to its flames!

29:41.840 --> 29:43.210
Traitors and rebels

29:43.840 --> 29:45.650
deserve to die at everyone's hands!

30:02.730 --> 30:03.280
Urgent report, Your Royal Highness!

30:03.490 --> 30:05.760
Princess Danyang leads
the North Jing cavalry

30:06.250 --> 30:07.210
and provincial troops.
They're 50 li away!

30:10.580 --> 30:13.220
(Guanghua Gate)

30:21.730 --> 30:22.280
Fall back!

30:24.520 --> 30:25.410
Retreat!

30:32.620 --> 30:35.060
(Guanghua Gate)

30:56.760 --> 30:57.080
Your Majesty.

30:57.250 --> 30:57.629
Your Majesty.

30:57.671 --> 31:00.551
(Guanghua Gate)

31:00.600 --> 31:01.280
I'm fine.

31:02.360 --> 31:03.450
You've all endured enough.

31:06.080 --> 31:07.080
Go on. Leave me.

32:50.360 --> 32:54.410
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

33:25.060 --> 33:26.300
(Huai)

33:59.320 --> 34:00.970
I knew she'd seek reinforcements,

34:01.450 --> 34:02.970
but I didn't expect them so soon.

34:03.410 --> 34:04.120
How many are there?

34:04.600 --> 34:05.560
Perhaps a hundred thousand.

34:07.760 --> 34:08.850
Go negotiate with Mu Wanyao.

34:09.560 --> 34:10.160
Get her to stop her troops.

34:11.850 --> 34:12.200
Your Royal Highness,

34:12.930 --> 34:14.010
I volunteer to go.

34:15.770 --> 34:16.640
If the talks fail,

34:17.560 --> 34:18.560
I'll accept any military punishment.

34:22.520 --> 34:23.120
Tan Yuanchun!

34:24.200 --> 34:24.520
Here!

34:25.330 --> 34:25.770
You go.

34:26.560 --> 34:26.850
Yes!

34:59.890 --> 35:01.810
I'm here on the Crown Prince's behalf

35:02.120 --> 35:03.890
to speak to the Princess Danyang,
Guardian of the Realm.

35:09.120 --> 35:11.370
You and your brother
have many misunderstandings.

35:12.010 --> 35:12.970
As an outsider,

35:13.410 --> 35:14.160
it's not my place to interfere.

35:14.600 --> 35:15.810
But there's one thing

35:16.200 --> 35:17.490
I must tell Your Highness.

35:18.330 --> 35:19.200
Yan Shang...

35:19.330 --> 35:19.680
Shut up!

35:21.200 --> 35:22.370
How dare you say his name?

35:23.040 --> 35:23.520
Your Highness,

35:24.160 --> 35:25.120
Yan Shang is alive.

35:33.890 --> 35:34.600
What did you say?

35:35.520 --> 35:37.160
Commander Yan was wounded and captured,

35:37.490 --> 35:38.200
but he's alive.

35:38.640 --> 35:40.410
He's in the Crown Prince's tent.

35:48.520 --> 35:50.850
You hardly know me, General Tan.

35:52.450 --> 35:53.290
So you have no idea

35:54.010 --> 35:55.040
what happens to those

35:55.890 --> 35:56.970
who dare lie to me.

35:58.890 --> 36:00.240
Yan Shang is alive.

36:00.930 --> 36:02.040
You'll see for yourself, Your Highness.

36:03.120 --> 36:04.720
If you agree to withdraw your troops

36:05.120 --> 36:06.720
and discuss affairs
with the Crown Prince,

36:07.450 --> 36:10.560
he'll guarantee Yan Shang's safety.

36:15.560 --> 36:16.490
You say he's alive.

36:19.160 --> 36:19.850
What proof do you have?

36:20.160 --> 36:20.810
If you don't believe me,

36:21.160 --> 36:22.520
come with me and see him yourself.

36:23.080 --> 36:23.890
Your Highness, you mustn't.

36:24.680 --> 36:25.120
Your Highness,

36:25.640 --> 36:26.680
Yan Shang is gravely wounded.

36:27.290 --> 36:27.850
Seeing you

36:28.560 --> 36:30.200
would surely give him the will to live.

36:32.200 --> 36:33.040
How badly wounded?

36:34.850 --> 36:35.290
So badly

36:36.770 --> 36:37.850
he couldn't even send me a token?

36:40.810 --> 36:41.450
He sent a message.

36:42.160 --> 36:45.330
Several words for you, Your Highness.

36:46.560 --> 36:47.810
Patience will bring things right.

36:48.450 --> 36:49.520
There is still time ahead.

36:55.040 --> 36:55.520
Your Highness,

36:56.410 --> 36:58.200
once the Crown Prince
takes Taiji Palace,

36:58.890 --> 37:00.290
he'll let you keep your title

37:00.930 --> 37:02.290
and let you choose your own fief.

37:06.410 --> 37:07.160
What fief?

37:08.410 --> 37:09.290
My home

37:09.770 --> 37:10.520
is here in Sheng'an!

37:10.970 --> 37:11.410
Your Highness,

37:11.850 --> 37:12.659
every word I've said is true...

37:12.701 --> 37:14.061
Say one more word,

37:14.970 --> 37:16.010
and I'll have you cut to pieces!

37:17.640 --> 37:18.040
Take him away!

37:30.890 --> 37:31.240
Your Highness,

37:32.770 --> 37:33.560
do you think that messenger

37:34.770 --> 37:35.330
was telling the truth?

37:45.600 --> 37:46.810
If Yan Shang really had been captured,

37:50.080 --> 37:51.240
he would have kept his mouth shut.

37:54.520 --> 37:55.770
He'd never have sent me a single word.

37:57.370 --> 37:58.120
So...

37:59.160 --> 38:00.770
Yan Shang really is...

38:00.970 --> 38:01.290
Gu Han.

38:11.640 --> 38:12.370
(Mu Xun.)

38:13.930 --> 38:15.410
(You're asking for it.)

38:23.450 --> 38:23.770
Your Royal Highness!

38:24.290 --> 38:25.080
His Majesty has passed away.

38:29.080 --> 38:29.930
Father...

38:33.930 --> 38:34.770
He's already...

38:40.240 --> 38:40.680
Your Royal Highness,

38:41.450 --> 38:42.200
we can't miss this chance.

38:43.240 --> 38:43.810
Let's attack the city.

38:48.770 --> 38:49.680
Attack the city.

38:53.200 --> 38:54.080
Attack!

39:52.260 --> 39:53.320
(Guanghua Gate)

40:12.240 --> 40:13.290
All troops, heed my command!

40:14.970 --> 40:15.890
Follow me and crush the rebels!

40:16.490 --> 40:17.010
Beat the drums!

40:18.540 --> 40:20.580
(Huai)

40:23.010 --> 40:26.940
Kill! Kill!

40:26.990 --> 40:30.970
Kill! Kill!

40:31.120 --> 40:31.930
- Those who yield shall live!
- Kill! Kill!

40:32.560 --> 40:33.429
- Those who resist shall die!
- Kill!

40:33.471 --> 40:37.438
Kill! Kill!

40:37.480 --> 40:41.520
Kill! Kill!

41:19.330 --> 41:19.810
(Yan Shang,)

41:20.890 --> 41:21.810
(get over here this instant!)

42:02.540 --> 42:06.980
♪A bamboo basket brims with lychees♪

42:07.620 --> 42:11.300
♪At dusk, our little boat drifts along♪

42:12.220 --> 42:17.060
♪Sunset clouds crown the treetops♪

42:17.060 --> 42:21.020
♪We drift on beyond twilight♪

42:21.820 --> 42:26.300
♪Words fail me over this cup of wine♪

42:26.780 --> 42:30.100
♪I still fear my ambitions
may go unfulfilled♪

42:31.060 --> 42:39.380
♪Pour out my cup and stir up the sea♪

43:07.290 --> 43:10.330
Your Royal Highness,
must this go on even now?

43:11.080 --> 43:11.850
On the battlefield,

43:12.850 --> 43:13.640
we fight until one side dies!

43:14.720 --> 43:15.970
We never had a choice!

43:17.450 --> 43:17.890
Yang Si,

43:18.970 --> 43:19.490
tonight,

43:20.290 --> 43:21.240
come with me

43:22.010 --> 43:23.080
and break through this city gate!

43:35.600 --> 43:37.080
(I'll put an end to all of this.)

43:46.240 --> 43:47.560
Yang Si!

43:48.930 --> 43:49.520
Come back...

44:51.140 --> 44:55.780
(Next Episode Preview)

44:55.850 --> 44:56.600
As a child,

44:57.370 --> 44:59.330
I used to imagine my wedding day.

44:59.720 --> 45:00.410
Later,

45:01.160 --> 45:03.450
I thought I'd never want to marry.

45:04.080 --> 45:06.120
I never thought I'd be lucky enough

45:07.080 --> 45:08.490
to marry her in this life.

45:09.850 --> 45:10.810
The ceremony is complete.

45:14.921 --> 45:18.214
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:20.899 --> 45:25.815
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:28.009 --> 45:33.854
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:34.354 --> 45:39.580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:42.349 --> 45:47.140
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:47.976 --> 45:54.055
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:55.856 --> 45:59.006
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:59.006 --> 46:00.654
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:00.706 --> 46:04.430
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:04.808 --> 46:09.474
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:10.093 --> 46:14.134
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:14.625 --> 46:16.740
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:16.780 --> 46:23.726
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:24.489 --> 46:27.942
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:28.122 --> 46:31.267
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:31.706 --> 46:38.343
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:38.740 --> 46:40.778
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:40.778 --> 46:43.254
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:43.292 --> 46:45.761
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:45.965 --> 46:52.852
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:53.164 --> 46:56.435
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:56.740 --> 46:59.913
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:00.237 --> 47:03.663
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:03.896 --> 47:07.121
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:07.452 --> 47:14.248
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:14.617 --> 47:16.679
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:16.680 --> 47:19.183
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:19.230 --> 47:21.568
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:21.799 --> 47:28.634
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:28.983 --> 47:30.601
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:30.731 --> 47:32.527
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:32.884 --> 47:35.901
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:35.941 --> 47:37.268
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
